swer/id #uuid "a78cf6fe-6959-5fd6-96cd-441cf7f5493b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\frac{4}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286315}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a78cf6fe-6959-5fd6-96cd-441cf7f5493b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\frac{4}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286315} :answer-field/id #uuid "aedfe451-3be4-545f-acac-1c1f5c95d11b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287509}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "418b906a-1baf-59eb-8935-edc0e9f8b503" :question/math-academy-id "q-19786" :question/problem "Let $a=⟨2x,1,4⟩,$ $b=⟨2,0,3⟩$ and $|\\,a\\times b\\,|=\\sqrt{13}.$ Find $x.$" :question/requires-calculator true :question/worked-solution "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =\\begin{vmatrix}i & j & k \\\\ 2x & 1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 3\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{vmatrix}i-\\begin{vmatrix}2x & 4 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{vmatrix}j+\\begin{vmatrix}2x & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{vmatrix}k \\\\  & =(3-0)i-(6x-8)j+(0-2)k \\\\  & =⟨3,-(6x-8),-2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, computing the magnitude, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+(-(6x-8))^{2}+(-2)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+36{x}^{2}-96x+64+4} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{36{x}^{2}-96x+77}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLastly, we solve for $x$ the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{13} \\\\ \\sqrt{36{x}^{2}-96x+77} & =\\sqrt{13} \\\\ 36{x}^{2}-96x+77 & =13 \\\\ 36{x}^{2}-96x+64 & =0 \\\\ 9{x}^{2}-24x+16 & =0 \\\\ (3x-4)^{2} & =0 \\\\ 3x-4 & =0 \\\\ x & =\\frac{4}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=\\frac{4}{3}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060195 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a8f75c6a-39ca-54ce-90b2-d2fed57bce1c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057631} {:answer/id #uuid "f1cc6fa4-5d2d-5ef7-8b9e-ca6b2a04a6df" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057632} {:answer/id #uuid "34efec5a-0267-59a9-a0e8-a8bbc8e3bbc3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057633} {:answer/id #uuid "626288b8-1266-5c66-8802-e4279b82a65f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057634} {:answer/id #uuid "65626e08-ea8e-5f2e-a56f-1de07c241265" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057635}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "34efec5a-0267-59a9-a0e8-a8bbc8e3bbc3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057633} :answer-field/id #uuid "1cb55465-244d-5741-a788-539ef4e5adf4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057630}] :question/id #uuid "e1d88843-5476-50c9-8034-3251a4933b8a" :question/math-academy-id "q-19801" :question/problem "If\n$$\n\\displaystyle A = \\begin{bmatrix}1 + t & 2t \\\\ -3 & 1 - t\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand $det(A) = 10$, what is the value of $t$?" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\det(A)&=\\begin{vmatrix}1+t & 2t \\\\ -3 & 1-t\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&=(1+t)(1-t)-(2t)(-3) \\\\\n&=1-t^2+6t.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\det(A)=10$, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n1-t^2+6t&=10 \\\\\nt^2-6t+9&=0 \\\\\n(t-3)^2&=0 \\\\\nt&=3.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060226 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "de421596-8167-5804-a274-26143d902b00" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sec θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057999} {:answer/id #uuid "e6596922-d870-5815-8caa-c56e9eb91672" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sec θ + 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058000} {:answer/id #uuid "0c6b0625-764d-5d59-a350-645fee24dd01" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\sec θ + 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058001} {:answer/id #uuid "4ac4f308-7003-5153-ac12-b065fa7cf226" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\sec θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058002} {:answer/id #uuid "5b6c8933-02d9-504c-9440-ef1eca3dfac2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sec θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058003}] :answer-field/id #uuid "d8f3fa84-4784-5fd5-9bd4-bf01c716de69" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057998}] :question/id #uuid "2e719436-9bd8-5170-a19c-63ea0460d236" :question/math-academy-id "q-23522" :question/problem "What is $\\cos θ + \\frac{\\sin^{2} θ}{\\cos θ}$?"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060343 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c86c4a78-21c0-5077-b5d6-2c8e5efd96b7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058681} {:answer/id #uuid "f30e1138-5284-51ea-a2ca-19c19dad8edb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058682} {:answer/id #uuid "328bdc2b-657f-5e7b-b85c-009cfa95d3f1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1759218